SUMMARY:Brian Regan
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $59 $69 $79 $89 \nCritics\, fans\, and fellow comedians agree … Brian Regan is one of the most respected comedians in the country with Vanity Fair calling Brian “The funniest stand-up alive” and Entertainment Weekly calling him “Your favorite comedian’s favorite comedian.”  Brian’s first Netflix special\, Brian Regan: Nunchucks and Flamethrowers\, premiered to rave reviews in 2017.  In 2021\, Brian premiered his second Netflix stand-up special\, Brian Regan: On The Rocks.  He recently returned for his third season in Peter Farrelly’s TV series\, Loudermilk\, and also stars in his own Netflix series\, Stand Up And Away! With Brian Regan\, which combines sketch comedy and stand-up. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/brian-regan-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/BR_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
